              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ચોર — cor — \"a thief\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ગઈકાલે રાત્રે એક ચોર અમારા ઘરમાં આવ્યો. gaīkāle rātre ek cor amārā gharmā̃ āvyo. Last night a thief got into our house."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A masculine or feminine noun, by the person meant."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ચોર (cor) is inherited from Sanskrit cōrá-, \"a thief\", and CDIAL lists the Gujarati word (CDIAL 4931). The verb ચોરવું, to steal, belongs to the same family."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
