          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "લોકો (loko) is the plural of lok, from Sanskrit lōká-, \"open space, the world\", which later also meant \"people\" (CDIAL 11119). Gujarati uses it in the plural, and a verb with it is plural too: લોકો આવ્યા."
